# First Alliance saber from Lelanai (Darnassus).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Tiger Riding (828;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Night Elves with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Jartsam teaches it to them at Exalted with Darnassus (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Human at Jartsam, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.
# ASSUMED: Lelanai sells Striped Dawnsaber too (a beta player guide lists it at this
# vendor, and the same NPC sells it in today's game; our data has no vendor row).
# In-game check: Lelanai's list.

step Learn to ride
  zone Darnassus
  tip Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 40 Jartsam teaches Riding to Night Elves for 100g (10% less at Honored with Darnassus), and it comes with a saber. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 4753 only NightElf            -- Jartsam, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Tiger Riding for other races
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  when !knows 828
  tip Any Alliance race can buy these sabers, but riding one also takes Tiger Riding, which only Night Elves get with Riding. Jartsam teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Darnassus (the Darnassus Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a saber for this character.
  rep "Darnassus" Exalted
  train 4753                          -- Jartsam, Tiger Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Lelanai sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 4730                         -- Lelanai
  buy 8629 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Striped Nightsaber, 20g
  buy 8631 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Striped Frostsaber, 20g
  buy 8632 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Spotted Frostsaber, 20g
  buy 274706 "Reins of the Striped Dawnsaber" npc 4730 optional -- new in Forever, 20g; beta players found it here
